(1,'Experion Developers & Infrastructure','experion-developers','TNRERA/PROM/0219/2026','2006','38+ Landmarks','18.4M+ sq.ft','99.2% Delivery Precision','Tower A, Level 8, OMR Tech Park, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600096','projects@experionbuilders.com','+91 94441 23456','https://experiondevelopers.com','Experion Developers is a premier cadastral land developer in Tamil Nadu, delivering 100% DTCP and TNRERA sanctioned layouts with individual patta title guarantee and dedicated lifetime infrastructure maintenance.','[{\"id\":\"up-1\",\"name\":\"Experion Cadastral Greens Phase II\",\"locality\":\"Kelambakkam Corridor\",\"city\":\"Chennai\",\"propertyType\":\"Gated CMDA Plots\",\"expectedLaunch\":\"Q1 2027\",\"startingPrice\":\"\\u20b9 38 Lakhs\",\"totalUnits\":\"64 Plotted Sites\",\"bannerUrl\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500382017468-9049fed747ef?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\",\"description\":\"40-ft bitumen frontage layout with underground drainage, rainwater harvesting, and avenue plantation.\"},{\"id\":\"up-2\",\"name\":\"Experion Royal Palms Enclave\",\"locality\":\"Vandalur - Kelambakkam Road\",\"city\":\"Chennai\",\"propertyType\":\"DTCP Sanctioned Plots\",\"expectedLaunch\":\"Mid 2027\",\"startingPrice\":\"\\u20b9 52 Lakhs\",\"totalUnits\":\"48 Villa Plots\",\"bannerUrl\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524813686514-a57563d77d61?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\",\"description\":\"Luxury plotted development abutting 100-ft state corridor with smart solar lighting and 3-tier gated security.\"}]','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560179707-f14e90ef3623?auto=format&fit=crop&w=300&q=80','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486406146926-c627a92ad1ab?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80',NULL,'2026-11-04 07:37:48'),
